{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Soccer Penalty Kick, feel the pressure, the roar of the crowd, and the thrill of the shot! Smash in impossible goals, outsmart the keeper, and rise as your team\u2019s hero. Every kick counts\u2014become a legend on the field!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/771ffd5b8834d34b8edd45b4303f60ce.webp?t=1757430200\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/ef865924141862a130378b2ed68f0a4f.poster.avif?t=1757430200\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/ef865924141862a130378b2ed68f0a4f.webm?t=1757430200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/ef865924141862a130378b2ed68f0a4f.mp4?t=1757430200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Soccer Penalty Kick</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer Penalty Kick features two exciting modes: Penalty Kick and Free Kick, each with three difficulty levels to challenge your aim, timing, and precision. Feel the intensity of every shot as you chase perfect goals under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/c43b1cc6826fac1ae799d634d0f29b8d.webp?t=1757430200\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/c7476f2ff2f42ecf31337ac1cf920f28.poster.avif?t=1757430200\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/c7476f2ff2f42ecf31337ac1cf920f28.webm?t=1757430200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/c7476f2ff2f42ecf31337ac1cf920f28.mp4?t=1757430200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with 2 stadiums, 3 uniforms, and 7 unique soccer balls. Whether you're practicing your skills or chasing high scores, the game delivers a focused, fast-paced experience that captures the thrill of the beautiful game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937500?t=1757430200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937500?t=1757430200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/167a9e3d9fe7770cdff40972fcc93a361a6ab607/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757430200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/167a9e3d9fe7770cdff40972fcc93a361a6ab607/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757430200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Soccer Penalty Kick</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937500/extras/b11f07e856ac6144bd827cd987769da6.avif?t=1757430200\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Soccer Penalty Kick, feel the pressure, the roar of the crowd, and the thrill of the shot! Smash in impossible goals, outsmart the keeper, and rise as 